you are interrupting the flow of story.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:31.140
If you're going to interrupt the momentum in&nbsp;
the present moment it has to be something that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:38.940
